00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:51.851
And yet they said,

00:10:51.851 --> 00:10:52.818
oh, this is a great guy.

00:10:52.818 --> 00:10:53.953
Let's go, let's go, let's go.

00:10:53.953 --> 00:10:55.021
So shame on everybody.

